# The knowledge base portal installs its own dependencies with npm and builds
# through its own scripts, never an Nx target — apps/ is outside the pnpm
# workspace. Nx still walks it, and its eslint plugin tries to load the app's
# flat config, which imports eslint-config-next from a node_modules the
# workspace install never creates. That one failure takes down the whole
# project graph, so every Nx target fails with "Failed to process project
# graph". frontline-widgets stays in: its image builds through `nx build`.
apps/knowledge-base
